# Regenerable scrape cache: 142 MB of raw Forestry England HTML.
# Rebuild with `python scripts/fetch.py` (resumable, skips anything already cached).
data/raw/

# The generated dataset IS committed on purpose: it is what the app ships and what makes
# the repo a working app rather than a build recipe. Regenerate with scripts/parse.py.

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

# Tile provider API key. It lives above the web root on the server and must never
# be committed: this repository is public.
tiles.key
*.key

# Review copies of outreach drafts. The markdown under docs/outreach/ is the source;
# the .docx is a regenerable working copy passed to a human to mark up, and an unsent
# draft addressed to a third party has no business in a public repository.
*.docx
